WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:39.124
<i>Widow 12, Foxtrot 217.</i>


00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:42.460
<i>Nothing seen.
We are RTB and Bingo.</i>


00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:45.797
<i>Foxtrot 217,
Widow 12 all copied.</i>


00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.333
<i>Safe trip home.
Contact Zeus for routing.</i>


00:02:48.365 --> 00:02:50.335
<i>Foxtrot 217 switching Zeus.</i>


00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:53.671
<i>Johnson, let base know
we are inbound, ETA minute 25.</i>


00:02:53.705 --> 00:02:55.607
<i>I'll tell them
to put the kettle on.</i>


00:02:55.639 --> 00:02:57.775
<i>Make mine a pint.</i>


00:02:57.808 --> 00:03:00.142
<i>Missile launch.
9 o'clock.</i>


00:03:00.176 --> 00:03:01.511
<i>Break right.</i>


00:03:03.145 --> 00:03:04.613
<i>Flares.</i>


00:03:24.699 --> 00:03:26.700
Thanks, Mum.


00:03:51.722 --> 00:03:54.256
Dream of flying.


00:04:15.543 --> 00:04:17.343
<i>I can't control.</i>


00:04:17.377 --> 00:04:20.246
<i>Losing altitude.</i>


00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:22.215
<i>Eject. Eject!</i>


00:04:52.642 --> 00:04:54.944
Sinclair, it's me.


00:04:54.977 --> 00:04:56.645
You're okay.


00:05:49.659 --> 00:05:53.228
I'm sorry for the inconvenience.


00:06:09.476 --> 00:06:10.878
Mayday, mayday.


00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:14.981
This is Foxtrot 217.
Does anybody copy? Over.


00:06:15.013 --> 00:06:20.552
Mayday, mayday. This is
Foxtrot 217. Do you copy?


00:06:20.585 --> 00:06:23.588
This is Foxtrot 217
transmitting in the blind.


00:06:23.622 --> 00:06:25.791
My aircraft is down
and my WSO is dead.


00:06:25.824 --> 00:06:27.426
The crash site is hot.


00:06:27.458 --> 00:06:29.627
Repeat. The crash site is hot.


00:06:29.659 --> 00:06:31.294
I can't stay here.


00:06:31.329 --> 00:06:34.432
Initiating evasion plan. Out.


00:09:26.615 --> 00:09:28.585
Look at that.


00:09:45.934 --> 00:09:49.202
Fuck. Fuck.


00:20:13.083 --> 00:20:14.485
Fuck! Did you see that?


00:20:14.518 --> 00:20:16.654
Look alive, people.
Possible target on our 12.


00:20:16.687 --> 00:20:18.689
Everett, get on the deuce.
Serano, hit the lights.


00:20:18.723 --> 00:20:21.123
For fuck's sake. Friendly!


00:20:21.156 --> 00:20:23.226
Is that a woman?


00:20:23.258 --> 00:20:24.794
Calm down, Casanova.


00:20:24.828 --> 00:20:26.662
Corporal, go check her out.
Serano, take the back.


00:20:26.696 --> 00:20:31.467
- Everett, eyes open.
- On it, Sarge.


00:20:31.501 --> 00:20:34.068
Great going, you morons.


00:20:34.101 --> 00:20:35.737
Show us your hands!


00:20:41.107 --> 00:20:42.643
Do I look like
a fucking insurgent?


00:20:42.677 --> 00:20:44.545
Gun.


00:20:46.313 --> 00:20:48.180
- We're not safe here.
- Tell me about it.


00:20:48.214 --> 00:20:50.082
- We have to go.
- Quicker we get this done,


00:20:50.115 --> 00:20:52.419
quicker we can get out of here.
- You have to listen to me.


00:20:52.453 --> 00:20:55.221
- Identify yourself.
- Flight Lieutenant Sinclair,


00:20:55.254 --> 00:20:56.623
Royal Air Force.


00:20:56.655 --> 00:20:59.090
- She checks out.
- Our missing pilot.


00:20:59.123 --> 00:21:01.393
You're God damn lucky
we found you out here.


00:21:01.427 --> 00:21:02.794
- Hey, that's mine!
- Back off!


00:21:02.827 --> 00:21:05.430
- Lafayette, take it easy.
- She's clear.


00:21:05.464 --> 00:21:07.398
Are you deaf
or just fucking dumb?


00:21:07.431 --> 00:21:08.800
We can't stay here!


00:21:08.833 --> 00:21:12.034
- Serano?
- I got nothing.


00:21:13.738 --> 00:21:17.375
Take a breath, Captain.
We got you.


00:21:20.644 --> 00:21:22.345
Located the crash site,


00:21:22.378 --> 00:21:25.213
found your WSO
along with four enemy KIA.


00:21:25.246 --> 00:21:26.682
We got you to thank for that?


00:21:26.716 --> 00:21:29.718
I can't take all the credit.


00:21:29.751 --> 00:21:33.621
Johnson bagged all of them,
saving my life.


00:21:33.655 --> 00:21:36.090
Well, you did good
getting this far.


00:21:36.123 --> 00:21:38.257
We'd just about given up on you.


00:21:38.293 --> 00:21:40.159
Come on.


00:21:40.193 --> 00:21:42.329
What a good job you did.


00:21:42.362 --> 00:21:44.230
Do I have a story to tell you.


00:21:44.264 --> 00:21:46.667
All right. All right.
Serano, get her in the vehicle.


00:21:46.699 --> 00:21:48.301
Patch her up on the way.


00:21:48.334 --> 00:21:50.636
Lafayette, let's go.


00:22:13.891 --> 00:22:15.793
Welcome to
Second Ranger Battalion


00:22:15.825 --> 00:22:18.293
Forward Operations Base,
Camp Cooper.


00:22:18.328 --> 00:22:20.263
Did anyone contact my CO?


00:22:20.295 --> 00:22:21.730
I need to get word to my family.


00:22:21.763 --> 00:22:23.533
Soon as you were picked up.


00:22:23.565 --> 00:22:25.132
Family know you're safe.


00:22:25.167 --> 00:22:28.169
Just let the doc
take a look at that wound.


00:22:28.201 --> 00:22:30.504
After I talk to your CI.


00:22:30.539 --> 00:22:34.174
Captain, we're all
a little mad here.


00:22:34.207 --> 00:22:37.478
Hell, you'd have to be crazy
not to be.


00:22:38.379 --> 00:22:41.514
A lot's happened
in the past 24 hours.


00:22:41.548 --> 00:22:44.784
This place has gone
from a ghost town to slap bang


00:22:44.818 --> 00:22:47.419
in the middle of the biggest
insurgent mobilization


00:22:47.454 --> 00:22:49.355
this sector has seen in years.


00:22:49.389 --> 00:22:52.790
Shooting down your aircraft
was just the opening salvo.


00:22:52.825 --> 00:22:57.629
Sir, I've flown 28 combat
missions in three tours,


00:22:57.663 --> 00:23:00.731
and yesterday I was shot down,
crashed in the desert,


00:23:00.764 --> 00:23:02.699
and hunted by men that wanted
to cut my head off


00:23:02.733 --> 00:23:04.335
and post it on YouTube.


00:23:04.368 --> 00:23:06.770
But none of that scared me


00:23:06.803 --> 00:23:09.338
half as much
as what I saw in that bunker.


00:23:09.372 --> 00:23:11.842
Captain, I don't doubt
your credentials,


00:23:11.874 --> 00:23:13.876
but given the present situation,


00:23:13.909 --> 00:23:18.446
the safety of my men
is paramount.


00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.250
Now, this place
may not look like much,


00:23:22.283 --> 00:23:24.352
but despite appearances,


00:23:24.385 --> 00:23:29.490
I like to run a tight ship.


00:23:29.523 --> 00:23:31.591
Patrol's coming in.


00:23:32.926 --> 00:23:35.662
Now, we were winding down
operations here,


00:23:35.696 --> 00:23:40.232
but now this new insurgency
requires the full extent


00:23:40.266 --> 00:23:44.436
of what little resources I have.


00:23:44.469 --> 00:23:46.571
Everything else
takes a back seat.


00:23:46.605 --> 00:23:48.874
- Cheers.
- After what I saw last night,


00:23:48.907 --> 00:23:51.743
I'd say insurgents are
the least of your worries.


00:23:53.778 --> 00:23:56.313
Listen, I get it.


00:23:56.347 --> 00:23:58.549
The violence they're capable of.


00:23:58.581 --> 00:24:00.350
The terror.


00:24:00.383 --> 00:24:02.786
It's easy to see them as
monsters, but they're just men.


00:24:02.820 --> 00:24:04.821
This was no fucking man, sir.


00:24:04.854 --> 00:24:07.290
I saw it rip a man's face
from his skull.


00:24:07.323 --> 00:24:10.492
It had claws the size of
a grizzly bear.


00:24:10.526 --> 00:24:12.360
- Major.
- Sergeant.


00:24:12.394 --> 00:24:16.699
Our British friends
picked up a terry on patrol.


00:24:16.731 --> 00:24:18.266
Could be one of the group
that brought down


00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:19.667
the captain's aircraft.


00:24:19.701 --> 00:24:21.269
Thank you, Sergeant.


00:24:21.303 --> 00:24:23.737
Let's see what
we can get out of him.


00:24:23.771 --> 00:24:26.273
Oh, they didn't happen
to come across


00:24:26.306 --> 00:24:28.542
any secret Russian bunkers,
did they?


00:24:28.576 --> 00:24:30.009
Sir?


00:24:30.043 --> 00:24:32.512
It's there.


00:24:32.546 --> 00:24:34.714
I can take you right to it.


00:24:34.747 --> 00:24:39.484
Captain, what combat experience
have you had?


00:24:40.519 --> 00:24:42.321
Well, I made it this far.


00:24:42.353 --> 00:24:43.988
I've seen her handiwork, sir.


00:24:44.022 --> 00:24:46.757
I can vouch for her.


00:24:46.791 --> 00:24:48.459
Cool your heels, Sergeant.


00:24:48.492 --> 00:24:50.561
Ain't nobody going no place.


00:24:50.594 --> 00:24:53.397
Sir, if you're not prepared
to take this threat seriously,


00:24:53.430 --> 00:24:55.398
then do me a favor and
get me on the first ride out.


00:24:55.432 --> 00:24:57.668
I wish I could, believe me.


00:24:57.701 --> 00:25:00.336
We already evac'd
all nonessentials,


00:25:00.370 --> 00:25:03.806
and they won't send another bird
until things cool off.


00:25:03.840 --> 00:25:06.943
So until then,
you remain our guest.


00:25:06.975 --> 00:25:10.978
And this microfilm camera here,


00:25:11.012 --> 00:25:15.317
well, this stays with me
till Army Intel gets eyes on it.


00:25:15.349 --> 00:25:16.650
That is all, Captain.


00:25:16.684 --> 00:25:18.652
Now, go see Doc Wilks.


00:25:18.686 --> 00:25:20.420
Get that wound seen to.


00:25:27.026 --> 00:25:28.494
Sir, I'd like to
go check it out.


00:25:28.527 --> 00:25:30.529
Dismissed, Sergeant.


00:25:35.434 --> 00:25:36.468
Hey.


00:25:36.502 --> 00:25:39.505
What's up?


00:25:39.538 --> 00:25:41.072
- Oh.
- You have my locket.


00:25:41.105 --> 00:25:43.341
- I don't know what you...
- Give me my fucking locket.


00:25:43.373 --> 00:25:45.076
- All right, girl! Let's go.
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, ladies.


00:25:45.109 --> 00:25:47.712
Hey, take it easy.


00:25:47.744 --> 00:25:50.046
- Lafayette, hand it over.
- Sarge, I don't have her...


00:25:50.080 --> 00:25:52.748
Just give it the fuck back.


00:25:56.952 --> 00:25:59.722
- I was just looking after it.
- Bullshit, Lafayette.


00:25:59.755 --> 00:26:01.856
How many times, huh?


00:26:01.890 --> 00:26:03.626
Back to your post.


00:26:05.427 --> 00:26:07.462
Whatever.


00:26:07.829 --> 00:26:11.331
Come on, then. Come on.


00:26:36.154 --> 00:26:39.590
Guessing you didn't get that
out of a Christmas cracker.


00:26:40.890 --> 00:26:43.693
Do you think I've lost
the plot, Sergeant?


00:26:46.529 --> 00:26:50.034
I've seen my share
of crazy shit.


00:26:50.066 --> 00:26:52.034
I fell down the rabbit hole
a long time ago.


00:26:52.067 --> 00:26:55.637
So who am I to judge?


00:26:58.140 --> 00:27:01.375
Come on,
let's get you over to Wilks.


00:27:06.480 --> 00:27:10.518
That major of yours
is quite the character.


00:27:10.551 --> 00:27:12.853
Believe it or not,
he was a full bird colonel


00:27:12.886 --> 00:27:16.057
till a few years back.


00:27:16.089 --> 00:27:19.458
We were ambushed
south of Kandahar,


00:27:19.491 --> 00:27:21.460
deep in Talib country.


00:27:21.493 --> 00:27:22.995
Hit us with everything they had.


00:27:23.028 --> 00:27:24.562
We got the order to fall back,


00:27:24.596 --> 00:27:26.698
but the colonel
kept pushing forward.


00:27:26.731 --> 00:27:30.501
Somewhere in the chaos,
two men got separated.


00:27:30.535 --> 00:27:32.904
Captured and killed.


00:27:32.936 --> 00:27:34.705
Brass threw him under the bus,


00:27:34.738 --> 00:27:37.541
busted him down to major
and sent him here


00:27:37.574 --> 00:27:39.476
to serve out his time.


00:27:39.508 --> 00:27:41.011
Why here?


00:27:41.044 --> 00:27:42.812
Well, because this is where
they shit-can


00:27:42.846 --> 00:27:46.815
all the burnouts,
washouts, and fuck ups.


00:27:46.849 --> 00:27:50.486
Lafayette, as you found out,
is a kleptomaniac.


00:27:50.518 --> 00:27:52.954
If it's shiny and expensive,
she'll take it.


00:27:52.988 --> 00:27:54.789
Can't help herself.


00:27:54.823 --> 00:27:56.124
Everett the rookie had


00:27:56.156 --> 00:27:57.626
an accidental discharge
in barracks.


00:27:57.659 --> 00:28:00.427
Shot a guy in the foot.


00:28:00.461 --> 00:28:03.697
Serano knocked up
two girls stateside.


00:28:03.730 --> 00:28:06.566
Both daughters
of an unhappy general.


00:28:06.600 --> 00:28:08.501
Wilks...


00:28:08.534 --> 00:28:11.203
Well, Wilks got hooked
on the meds.


00:28:11.238 --> 00:28:13.105
Don't worry.
He's clean now.


00:28:13.139 --> 00:28:15.107
I think.


00:28:15.141 --> 00:28:17.743
So I got rescued by
the Dirty Half-Dozen.


00:28:20.678 --> 00:28:23.648
What's your story?


00:28:28.586 --> 00:28:31.188
The two men we lost
were from my unit.


00:28:31.222 --> 00:28:36.226
Finch took the heat,
but it was my fault.


00:28:36.260 --> 00:28:38.728
Shit happens on the battlefield.


00:28:40.896 --> 00:28:42.865
And in the air.


00:28:44.699 --> 00:28:46.769
This is Major Roy Finch.


00:28:46.801 --> 00:28:48.570
Put me through
to Colonel Eugene Harper,


00:28:48.603 --> 00:28:51.572
Military Intelligence, INSCOM.


00:28:53.073 --> 00:28:56.476
Colonel Harper, been a while.


00:28:56.510 --> 00:28:58.178
Yes, sir.


00:28:58.213 --> 00:28:59.880
When you put me in command here,


00:28:59.914 --> 00:29:02.783
you asked me to report
any unusual activity


00:29:02.816 --> 00:29:04.718
in the sector directly to you.


00:29:04.751 --> 00:29:08.854
I suggest you check your e-mail.


00:29:11.623 --> 00:29:14.693
I know a bullet wound
when I see one.


00:29:16.228 --> 00:29:18.230
And this is no
fucking bullet wound.


00:29:19.965 --> 00:29:23.934
It's going to leave
a hell of a scar, Lieutenant.


00:29:23.968 --> 00:29:27.170
Or is it "Leftenant"?
I can never remember.


00:29:31.208 --> 00:29:33.576
You were there.


00:29:33.610 --> 00:29:35.544
You saw it, too.
Why don't you say something?


00:29:35.577 --> 00:29:36.980
Don't waste your breath.


00:29:37.013 --> 00:29:39.548
I don't think he speaks
a word of English.


00:29:39.581 --> 00:29:41.183
And don't get too close.


00:29:44.186 --> 00:29:47.256
Captain, you got a minute?


00:29:47.289 --> 00:29:49.090
I'm not going anywhere.


00:29:49.123 --> 00:29:51.726
Hold up there, Hooky.


00:29:51.759 --> 00:29:53.793
Don't you know it's
a court-martial offense


00:29:53.828 --> 00:29:56.196
to question a British officer
without another member


00:29:56.230 --> 00:29:58.163
of Her Majesty's forces present?


00:29:58.198 --> 00:29:59.865
It is?


00:29:59.899 --> 00:30:02.203
So far as you know.


00:30:02.236 --> 00:30:04.837
Captain, Sergeant Oswald Jones.


00:30:04.870 --> 00:30:06.972
His patrol stopped by
for a cup of tea,


00:30:07.007 --> 00:30:09.108
and now we can't get rid of him.


00:30:09.140 --> 00:30:12.877
It's the special relationship
and all that bollocks, see?


00:30:12.909 --> 00:30:16.047
We provide some intel,
they supply us with brew.


00:30:16.080 --> 00:30:19.716
No PG Tips, mind you,
but beggars can't be choosers.


00:30:19.751 --> 00:30:21.853
And besides,


00:30:21.885 --> 00:30:25.555
the shit's about
to kick off 'round here.


00:30:25.589 --> 00:30:27.089
Oh, we'd hate to miss the party.


00:30:27.124 --> 00:30:28.624
You lads SAS?


00:30:28.657 --> 00:30:30.960
Couldn't really say.


00:30:30.993 --> 00:30:34.296
Heard you had a spot
of argy-bargy yourself.


00:30:34.331 --> 00:30:36.332
That's one way of putting it.


00:30:36.365 --> 00:30:39.134
That was some excellent
soldiering, ma'am.


00:30:39.167 --> 00:30:41.036
Not bad for a jockey.


00:30:41.069 --> 00:30:43.338
You're done. Get you up.


00:30:43.371 --> 00:30:46.274
I'll take that as a compliment.


00:30:46.306 --> 00:30:49.108
How could I help you?


00:30:49.143 --> 00:30:51.178
Yeah, something's bugging me.


00:30:51.211 --> 00:30:53.147
I know our AO pretty well,


00:30:53.180 --> 00:30:56.350
but there's nothing like this
bunker in any satellite images,


00:30:56.382 --> 00:30:58.017
any maps, anywhere.


00:30:58.051 --> 00:31:00.820
Well, it would be hard to spot
from the air.


00:31:00.853 --> 00:31:02.288
But it's there,


00:31:02.321 --> 00:31:04.323
and it has been
for quite a while.


00:31:04.357 --> 00:31:07.758
The door was chained shut
with some kind of...


00:31:07.792 --> 00:31:09.693
Some kind of writing on it.


00:31:09.728 --> 00:31:12.364
Pass me that chart.


00:31:12.397 --> 00:31:14.130
Yeah.


00:31:14.164 --> 00:31:17.934
Here. There you go.


00:31:19.836 --> 00:31:22.604
- How'd you do that?
- Photographic memory.


00:31:22.639 --> 00:31:24.907
Don't know what it means, but...


00:31:26.910 --> 00:31:29.745
- What is that?
- It looks like gobbledygook.


00:31:29.777 --> 00:31:32.780
It's Russian.


00:31:32.814 --> 00:31:36.150
It means "Do not open."


00:31:36.184 --> 00:31:38.287
Would you look at that?


00:31:38.320 --> 00:31:39.854
He speaks Russian.


00:31:39.887 --> 00:31:42.923
And English.


00:31:42.956 --> 00:31:46.025
Whatever she told you,


00:31:46.059 --> 00:31:47.961
it's worse.


00:31:47.994 --> 00:31:49.896
Wait a second.


00:31:49.929 --> 00:31:51.765
If this bunker is Soviet,


00:31:51.798 --> 00:31:53.998
that's got to be 30 years old.


00:31:54.032 --> 00:31:56.801
- More.
- 30 years.


00:31:56.835 --> 00:31:59.305
No way a human could
live down there for that long.


00:31:59.339 --> 00:32:01.241
It's not human.


00:32:06.845 --> 00:32:09.415
You mentioned seeing containers.


00:32:09.447 --> 00:32:13.218
Yes. And every container had
one of those things inside.


00:32:13.251 --> 00:32:16.019
It could be some kind of stasis.


00:32:17.753 --> 00:32:20.890
What the hell were those
Russkies doing down there?


00:33:25.079 --> 00:33:26.348
Whoa, whoa.


00:33:26.382 --> 00:33:27.882
Hold your fire.


00:33:27.915 --> 00:33:30.851
Jesus, Everett.


00:33:30.885 --> 00:33:33.053
What kind of white boy move
was that?


00:33:33.086 --> 00:33:36.122
You gonna get your ass shot off
pulling shit like that.


00:33:36.155 --> 00:33:37.858
Thought you could use a coffee.


00:33:37.890 --> 00:33:40.059
You can bring me all
the cups of coffee you want,


00:33:40.092 --> 00:33:41.860
it ain't gonna get you
in my shorts.


00:33:41.893 --> 00:33:44.198
- It's just a cup of coffee.
- Bullshit.


00:33:46.898 --> 00:33:50.034
Word is that a pilot
we picked up


00:33:50.067 --> 00:33:52.737
saw some weird-ass creature
out there.


00:33:52.771 --> 00:33:54.005
Are you fucking with me?


00:33:54.038 --> 00:33:56.073
She probably stir-crazy.


00:33:56.107 --> 00:33:57.475
It's the heat.


00:33:57.508 --> 00:34:00.211
It's enough to send anyone
over the edge.


00:34:00.244 --> 00:34:02.279
Back to North Carolina,


00:34:02.313 --> 00:34:04.315
people talk about Bigfoot


00:34:04.348 --> 00:34:07.484
like he's real as you and me.


00:34:07.518 --> 00:34:09.052
They all crazy, too?


00:34:09.084 --> 00:34:11.287
Hell yeah.


00:34:30.903 --> 00:34:32.540
Evening, lads.


00:34:32.573 --> 00:34:35.040
How's it going, Taff?


00:34:35.075 --> 00:34:36.876
Got fresh brew on here
if you want one.


00:34:36.909 --> 00:34:38.545
Champion.


00:34:38.577 --> 00:34:41.180
What other culinary delights
you got in store, Bromhead?


00:34:41.213 --> 00:34:43.550
Well, we've got an aperitif
of chicken curry,


00:34:43.582 --> 00:34:45.149
followed by
chicken curry entree.


00:34:45.184 --> 00:34:47.486
For dessert,
chicken curry sorbet


00:34:47.519 --> 00:34:49.886
with lashings of chicken curry.


00:34:49.921 --> 00:34:52.224
Compliments to the chef.


00:34:52.257 --> 00:34:55.260
Hughes, you be Mum. Dish up.


00:34:57.527 --> 00:34:59.497
Want to tell us
what's going on then, Taff?


00:34:59.529 --> 00:35:01.797
Yeah, what's the word
on the jockey, guv?


00:35:01.831 --> 00:35:03.899
Just make sure
your kit's in order.


00:35:03.933 --> 00:35:07.471
We're open on stag tonight,
three-hour shifts.


00:35:07.503 --> 00:35:09.070
We expecting trouble?


00:35:09.104 --> 00:35:11.507
This is the regiment, Bromhead.


00:35:11.540 --> 00:35:14.142
We always expect trouble.


00:35:32.525 --> 00:35:34.861
Fuckers.


00:35:38.364 --> 00:35:40.466
Patch me through to INSCOM.


00:35:40.500 --> 00:35:43.435
Colonel Harper's office.


00:35:43.468 --> 00:35:46.170
Colonel. Major Finch.


00:35:46.203 --> 00:35:48.172
Did you read the report?


00:35:48.205 --> 00:35:50.509
She makes for one hell
of a credible witness,


00:35:50.542 --> 00:35:52.410
don't you think?


00:35:57.880 --> 00:35:59.617
Oh, I have it.


00:35:59.649 --> 00:36:03.051
But if you want
to get your hands on it,


00:36:03.085 --> 00:36:07.357
you better tell me
what the hell is going on here.


00:36:12.927 --> 00:36:14.630
So what's your name?


00:36:14.663 --> 00:36:19.065
Kabir Abdul Rahimi.


00:36:26.673 --> 00:36:30.276
You shot me down, Kabir,
and killed my WSO.


00:36:30.310 --> 00:36:33.078
No. I didn't.


00:36:33.112 --> 00:36:35.146
I'm just a driver.


00:36:35.181 --> 00:36:38.416
I don't shoot anything.
I'm not a violent man.


00:36:38.450 --> 00:36:41.219
Then you're hanging
with the wrong crowd, Kabir.


00:36:41.252 --> 00:36:43.555
Why were you with them?


00:36:43.588 --> 00:36:45.156
Why?


00:36:45.189 --> 00:36:48.292
Do you think I have a choice?
Huh?


00:36:48.326 --> 00:36:51.027
I must do it
to protect my family.


00:36:51.061 --> 00:36:54.197
If you're not with them,
then you're against them.


00:36:54.231 --> 00:36:58.066
And this... this cannot be.


00:37:01.237 --> 00:37:03.105
You ever fancy
a real man's sport,


00:37:03.137 --> 00:37:05.340
you should have
a crack at rugby.


00:37:05.374 --> 00:37:07.509
You'd make a decent fullback,
I reckon,


00:37:07.542 --> 00:37:09.977
like the great J.P.R. himself.


00:37:10.009 --> 00:37:11.579
J.P.R.?


00:37:11.611 --> 00:37:13.547
J.P.R. Williams.


00:37:13.581 --> 00:37:15.515
Most fearless player
that ever lived,


00:37:15.549 --> 00:37:19.051
the kind of man who'd run
towards the bulls of Pamplona.


00:37:19.084 --> 00:37:20.420
- Jonesy, Serano.
- All right, Mush?


00:37:20.454 --> 00:37:22.356
- Sarge.
- I was just telling


00:37:22.389 --> 00:37:24.190
your man here the difference
between rugby and football.


00:37:24.224 --> 00:37:26.592
Well, American football,
that is.


00:37:26.625 --> 00:37:29.461
Sport in which the foot
rarely encounters the ball,


00:37:29.495 --> 00:37:33.364
unlike rugby, in which a player
is often kicked in the nuts.


00:37:33.399 --> 00:37:35.166
Fascinating.


00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.334
Serano, you're up.


00:37:36.368 --> 00:37:37.968
Go relieve Everett.


00:37:38.001 --> 00:37:39.536
Sarge.


00:37:41.004 --> 00:37:44.374
What do you...
What do you make of all this?


00:37:44.408 --> 00:37:47.344
Well, I don't know about you,


00:37:47.377 --> 00:37:51.314
but I won't be sleeping tonight.


00:37:51.348 --> 00:37:54.015
You and the boys stick around?


00:37:54.049 --> 00:37:56.051
Go where the storm carries you?


00:37:56.084 --> 00:37:58.153
We are the storm, mate.


00:37:58.186 --> 00:38:00.255
We'll hang around.


00:38:00.288 --> 00:38:02.357
See what's occurring.


00:38:06.460 --> 00:38:09.329
It's past your bedtime,
huh, Everett?


00:38:12.533 --> 00:38:14.602
Why don't you go
get some sleep, huh?


00:38:14.635 --> 00:38:16.170
I got this.


00:38:16.202 --> 00:38:19.273
That's mighty kind of you.


00:38:19.305 --> 00:38:22.407
And a... a word of advice.


00:38:22.442 --> 00:38:24.609
Don't try so hard
with Lafayette, man.


00:38:24.644 --> 00:38:27.279
She's not the needy type.


00:38:30.047 --> 00:38:32.249
And you might want to
take a shower.


00:38:32.284 --> 00:38:36.119
- Asshole.
- Dude, seriously, man, you c...


00:38:40.391 --> 00:38:42.293
What the...?


00:38:44.494 --> 00:38:46.496
Serano?


00:38:48.697 --> 00:38:51.366
Quit screwing around, dude.


00:38:58.473 --> 00:39:00.073
Fucking hell, Keyes.


00:39:00.106 --> 00:39:02.008
What crawled up your ass
and died?


00:39:04.679 --> 00:39:06.446
He who smelt it dealt it.


00:39:08.047 --> 00:39:09.648
He who said the rhyme
committed the crime.


00:39:09.683 --> 00:39:12.586
I blame your fucking
chicken curry, mate.


00:39:17.156 --> 00:39:19.358
Except it ain't coming
from your direction.


00:39:25.563 --> 00:39:27.632
Serano?


00:39:33.804 --> 00:39:36.572
Holy shit.


00:39:40.142 --> 00:39:42.813
Son of a bitch.


00:39:42.845 --> 00:39:44.747
Come on.


00:39:44.780 --> 00:39:47.249
Show your fucking selves.


00:39:50.252 --> 00:39:52.319
Sod this malarkey.


00:39:52.353 --> 00:39:54.421
Contact!


00:39:56.458 --> 00:39:58.359
It's here.


00:40:02.729 --> 00:40:05.199
Contact!
Front! Get to position!


00:40:05.232 --> 00:40:07.065
O'Neill, south wall!


00:40:07.099 --> 00:40:09.268
Hughes, man the .50-cal
and hold the gate!


00:40:09.302 --> 00:40:11.304
Use your infrared.
Go, go, go.


00:40:11.337 --> 00:40:14.407
Lafayette, suppressing fire.


00:40:14.439 --> 00:40:16.073
Serano, talk to me.


00:40:16.107 --> 00:40:17.375
Serano's gone.


00:40:17.409 --> 00:40:19.644
Something fucking took him.


00:40:20.745 --> 00:40:22.480
What the fuck are we firing at?


00:40:22.513 --> 00:40:25.584
- They're fucking huge.
- What's coming, Brommy?


00:40:25.616 --> 00:40:28.117
Something's moving out there,
but I don't know what.


00:40:28.152 --> 00:40:29.586
Shit the bed.


00:40:29.619 --> 00:40:31.120
Sinclair's bogeymen.


00:40:31.155 --> 00:40:32.422
You what, Taff?


00:40:32.455 --> 00:40:34.558
Just shoot any fucker
that moves.


00:40:37.527 --> 00:40:41.130
Peterson, Travis, get to
the south wall. Support O'Neill!


00:40:41.163 --> 00:40:44.533
I don't want these fuckers
getting 'round back of us.


00:40:44.566 --> 00:40:46.267
Lafayette, sit rep.


00:40:46.301 --> 00:40:48.101
Multiple unknown targets


00:40:48.135 --> 00:40:51.506
advancing from the north
and west.


00:40:51.539 --> 00:40:54.507
Over to the 8! Aim for the 8!


00:40:58.779 --> 00:41:00.747
No, look to the left!


00:41:02.415 --> 00:41:04.517
The others got out.
They must have tracked me.


00:41:04.551 --> 00:41:06.453
How can they do that?


00:41:14.759 --> 00:41:16.528
Major.


00:41:16.561 --> 00:41:17.861
Sergeant, report.


00:41:17.895 --> 00:41:19.497
We're under attack, sir.


00:41:19.530 --> 00:41:21.399
How can we be under attack?


00:41:21.431 --> 00:41:23.400
I don't hear any incoming fire.


00:41:23.433 --> 00:41:24.702
It's not insurgents, sir.


00:41:26.469 --> 00:41:28.772
They don't sound like that.


00:41:28.805 --> 00:41:31.140
Holy shit.


00:41:31.174 --> 00:41:32.608
What are the rules
of engagement?


00:41:32.641 --> 00:41:34.310
Weapons free, Sergeant.


00:41:34.344 --> 00:41:36.612
Kill anything that shrieks.


00:41:36.645 --> 00:41:38.246
Copy that.


00:41:38.279 --> 00:41:41.750
You still think I'm crazy,
Lafayette?


00:41:41.783 --> 00:41:43.750
I'll cut you some slack.


00:41:47.922 --> 00:41:51.525
Fuck! Everett!


00:41:51.558 --> 00:41:53.526
Son of a bitch.


00:41:56.896 --> 00:41:59.466
Man down! Medic!


00:41:59.499 --> 00:42:00.899
Stay here.


00:42:00.933 --> 00:42:02.568
Where the fuck is my sidearm?


00:42:02.600 --> 00:42:04.169
The rest of the confiscated
weapons in there.


00:42:04.202 --> 00:42:05.938
Finch has the key. Sorry.
Watch him.


00:42:05.971 --> 00:42:07.773
Watch him do what? Watch me?


00:42:11.309 --> 00:42:13.811
Fuck.


00:42:13.845 --> 00:42:17.214
Command, this is Camp Cooper.
We are under attack.


00:42:17.246 --> 00:42:20.651
Repeat. We...
We are under attack.


00:42:20.684 --> 00:42:23.553
Come in.


00:42:23.587 --> 00:42:25.188
Shit!


00:42:29.225 --> 00:42:30.793
Hey. Come on, now, buddy.


00:42:30.826 --> 00:42:32.727
Come on, now.


00:42:34.262 --> 00:42:35.665
Shit!


00:42:37.598 --> 00:42:40.268
What the fuck?


00:42:49.909 --> 00:42:53.445
Jones, we need support
on the east wall!


00:42:53.478 --> 00:42:55.547
Right you are, Hooky!


00:42:55.580 --> 00:42:57.517
Keep at them, boyo!


00:42:57.549 --> 00:43:00.217
It's like a Friday night
in Cardiff!


00:43:00.252 --> 00:43:01.819
Fucking radgie.


00:43:01.852 --> 00:43:04.655
I got no idea
what you just said.


00:43:09.927 --> 00:43:12.730
You toothy bastard!


00:43:12.763 --> 00:43:17.333
You picked the wrong
foxhole to fuck with.


00:43:32.713 --> 00:43:34.414
I got you. Come on.


00:43:34.448 --> 00:43:36.984
Fuck. Come on, man.


00:43:41.621 --> 00:43:44.291
Fall back now!


00:43:46.692 --> 00:43:49.628
You heard the man!
Move your arse!


00:43:54.966 --> 00:43:56.668
Shit.


00:44:03.440 --> 00:44:05.777
Peterson and Travis are down.


00:44:05.809 --> 00:44:07.377
Where the fuck is O'Neill?


00:44:10.913 --> 00:44:13.250
They're outside the wall.


00:44:49.047 --> 00:44:50.681
Ah!


00:45:20.408 --> 00:45:22.710
Fall back!


00:45:26.947 --> 00:45:29.817
Hughes, on me! Come on!


00:45:29.849 --> 00:45:31.384
Move, you fucking muppet!


00:45:31.418 --> 00:45:33.953
Muffing it, you are!


00:45:33.987 --> 00:45:35.053
Shit!


00:45:35.087 --> 00:45:37.022
Hughes!


00:45:40.759 --> 00:45:42.027
Ah!


00:45:44.062 --> 00:45:45.730
Fucking hell, Brommy!


00:45:45.764 --> 00:45:47.532
Don't fire!


00:45:49.700 --> 00:45:51.369
Incoming!


00:45:51.402 --> 00:45:53.703
Bast...


00:45:53.737 --> 00:45:55.840
You fucking bell end!


00:46:11.954 --> 00:46:14.022
Right, me old traitor,
you're coming with us.


00:46:14.055 --> 00:46:15.691
Fucking move.


00:46:15.723 --> 00:46:17.625
Shift it. Go on.


00:46:22.696 --> 00:46:24.665
Shit, Sinclair.


00:46:24.698 --> 00:46:26.399
On me, on me.


00:46:31.837 --> 00:46:34.141
Regroup!
Fall back to the trench!


00:46:34.174 --> 00:46:35.740
Come on.


00:46:40.043 --> 00:46:41.679
Glad you could make it, Captain.


00:46:41.714 --> 00:46:43.781
What's the plan, Stan?


00:46:48.819 --> 00:46:50.419
Park it, boyo.


00:46:50.454 --> 00:46:53.023
And no playing silly buggers
or I'll slot you.


00:46:54.924 --> 00:46:56.959
Where the fuck did they go?


00:46:56.993 --> 00:46:59.529
They're sneaky bastards,
I reckon.


00:47:02.132 --> 00:47:03.833
All right.


00:47:03.865 --> 00:47:05.134
Lafayette,
fall back to the armory.


00:47:05.167 --> 00:47:07.936
Jones, give me
some covering fire.


00:47:07.968 --> 00:47:09.105
Covering for what?


00:47:09.137 --> 00:47:10.804
I'm going for the major.


00:47:10.838 --> 00:47:13.209
Wilks, you're with me.


00:47:13.241 --> 00:47:15.509
For fuck's sake.


00:47:37.596 --> 00:47:39.530
Sod this for a game of soldiers.


00:47:39.562 --> 00:47:42.066
Mind your fucking necking,
Brommy, and shift it.


00:47:52.176 --> 00:47:54.543
Flash bang!


00:47:59.013 --> 00:48:01.916
Batter up, you son of a bitch.


00:48:16.596 --> 00:48:18.465
About done there, Major?


00:48:20.967 --> 00:48:23.769
Fuck.
Fuck, who's got the key?


00:48:23.802 --> 00:48:25.937
- I got a key.
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.


00:48:25.971 --> 00:48:27.773
Easy, tiger.
Let's not shoot the ammunition.


00:48:27.805 --> 00:48:29.075
I've got previous with
this sort of thing,


00:48:29.108 --> 00:48:31.576
so keep those bastards
off my back.


00:48:36.948 --> 00:48:38.982
You okay? Your head is bleeding.


00:48:39.016 --> 00:48:40.751
Let it bleed.


00:48:40.784 --> 00:48:42.952
Base is compromised.
Six men are down.


00:48:42.986 --> 00:48:44.954
We're falling back
to the armory.


00:48:44.988 --> 00:48:47.125
Sergeant, take command.


00:48:47.157 --> 00:48:48.992
You don't need any dead weight.


00:48:49.025 --> 00:48:51.960
Nice speech.
Now let's go.


00:48:51.994 --> 00:48:54.298
God damn it. Leave me.


00:48:54.330 --> 00:48:56.765
Major, we're getting you back.
Come on.


00:48:59.335 --> 00:49:00.969
Still got it.


00:49:01.002 --> 00:49:03.838
Nice work, Bromhead.


00:49:03.872 --> 00:49:05.972
You got to be
fucking kidding me.


00:49:06.006 --> 00:49:08.609
Someone's really
taking the piss now.


00:49:08.642 --> 00:49:09.843
Come on.


00:49:09.876 --> 00:49:12.012
Get in. Get in there.


00:49:14.081 --> 00:49:16.616
Here they come.


00:49:16.648 --> 00:49:18.218
Go for the kisser.


00:49:18.251 --> 00:49:20.253
That's the sweet spot.


00:49:23.921 --> 00:49:25.891
Contact.


00:49:25.923 --> 00:49:27.859
Corporal, take it out!


00:49:27.893 --> 00:49:29.927
Check your fire!


00:49:36.134 --> 00:49:37.600
What the fuck?


00:49:37.634 --> 00:49:41.204
Go on!
Hack its fucking head off!


00:49:41.238 --> 00:49:43.873
Smile for the fucking camera.


00:49:45.841 --> 00:49:48.111
Move! Move your fucking asses!


00:49:48.144 --> 00:49:50.712
Get it in the hole!


00:49:50.745 --> 00:49:52.148
It's coming!


00:49:52.181 --> 00:49:54.316
Everybody, go, go, go!


00:49:57.786 --> 00:50:00.155
Lock the fucking
door! Lock it!


00:50:08.362 --> 00:50:10.096
Think they've had enough?


00:50:10.130 --> 00:50:12.098
You want to stick your head out
and see?


00:50:12.132 --> 00:50:14.267
At least we've given them
something to think about.


00:50:14.300 --> 00:50:16.169
Yeah. Take heart.


00:50:16.202 --> 00:50:20.106
Nothing quite like a kebab
in a box to round off the night.


00:50:22.307 --> 00:50:23.809
How is he doing?


00:50:23.841 --> 00:50:26.244
Out cold, but he's alive.


00:50:33.316 --> 00:50:35.886
What are we gonna do, Sarge?


00:50:35.919 --> 00:50:37.720
All we can do.


00:50:37.754 --> 00:50:38.954
Hang tight.


00:50:38.987 --> 00:50:40.989
Wait for daylight.


00:50:41.023 --> 00:50:43.625
See if our odds improve.


00:51:09.448 --> 00:51:12.184
Caught this one
trying to make a run for it.


00:51:12.218 --> 00:51:14.320
Can you blame him?


00:51:14.353 --> 00:51:16.322
No.


00:51:16.355 --> 00:51:18.722
Still can't trust him, though.


00:51:18.756 --> 00:51:21.127
He saved my life quick enough.


00:51:21.159 --> 00:51:23.329
Well, he had one of those
bastards bang to rights,


00:51:23.360 --> 00:51:24.828
but he didn't fire.


00:51:24.862 --> 00:51:26.029
Why is that?


00:51:26.064 --> 00:51:27.830
Why don't you ask him?


00:51:27.865 --> 00:51:30.666
He speaks English.


00:51:30.701 --> 00:51:33.735
It's Kabir, isn't it?


00:51:34.204 --> 00:51:38.039
If you got something to tell us,
now's the time.


00:51:38.075 --> 00:51:41.041
Or would you rather
take your chances out there?


00:51:41.077 --> 00:51:43.346
With them.


00:51:52.152 --> 00:51:57.358
I wasn't even born when
the Russians invaded my country.


00:51:57.391 --> 00:51:59.758
The people of my village said


00:51:59.791 --> 00:52:01.693
they knew that
the invasion was coming


00:52:01.727 --> 00:52:05.898
because a star had fallen
to earth and shook the ground.


00:52:06.266 --> 00:52:11.869
They believed it was a sign
from God to begin our holy war.


00:52:14.206 --> 00:52:17.908
So my mother taught me to
learn the ways of our enemy


00:52:17.942 --> 00:52:21.077
while my father fought
with the Mujahideen.


00:52:26.217 --> 00:52:27.983
And by winter of 1988,


00:52:28.017 --> 00:52:31.421
Afghan forces had begun
to turn the tide.


00:52:31.453 --> 00:52:33.155
We had Stinger missiles


00:52:33.189 --> 00:52:35.257
and could shoot their aircraft
from the sky.


00:52:35.291 --> 00:52:38.460
Tell me about it.


00:52:39.496 --> 00:52:43.264
For the first time
in nine years, there was hope.


00:52:43.297 --> 00:52:45.466
But that was when it began.


00:52:46.934 --> 00:52:49.470
First one man disappeared,
then another,


00:52:49.504 --> 00:52:52.472
and then women, too,
always at night.


00:52:52.507 --> 00:52:54.342
Sometimes we found bodies


00:52:54.374 --> 00:52:58.044
mauled like a beast
that takes its prey.


00:52:58.078 --> 00:53:02.516
We thought it was
a wolf or a bear.


00:53:02.548 --> 00:53:06.750
So my father led the hunt
to kill the beast.


00:53:06.784 --> 00:53:09.088
But as suddenly as it began,


00:53:09.120 --> 00:53:11.121
when the Soviets withdrew,


00:53:11.155 --> 00:53:14.359
it ended.


00:53:14.392 --> 00:53:17.462
We lost 46 villagers,


00:53:17.494 --> 00:53:19.963
including my father.


00:53:21.864 --> 00:53:24.900
He never returned from the hunt.


00:53:55.462 --> 00:53:58.097
Serano, Hughes,
they're all gone.


00:53:58.131 --> 00:54:00.199
There's blood trails
headed west.


00:54:00.233 --> 00:54:02.200
Where they came from.


00:54:02.234 --> 00:54:04.068
Why would they take the bodies?


00:54:04.102 --> 00:54:06.836
Something ungodly, I expect.


00:54:06.869 --> 00:54:11.041
Lafayette, report.


00:54:11.075 --> 00:54:15.045
No movement.
Coast is clear, Sarge.


00:54:15.079 --> 00:54:18.047
All right. Keep a lookout.


00:54:24.387 --> 00:54:26.222
How are you holding up?


00:54:26.256 --> 00:54:27.822
Oh, you know.


00:54:27.856 --> 00:54:30.257
Nothing a cup of tea
and a biscuit won't fix.


00:54:30.292 --> 00:54:32.427
Is that British understatement?


00:54:34.161 --> 00:54:35.563
My old man used to say,
"If you don't want life


00:54:35.597 --> 00:54:37.931
to bite you in the ass,


00:54:37.964 --> 00:54:40.067
better learn to
kick it in the teeth."


00:54:40.101 --> 00:54:42.403
Quite the motivational speaker,
your dad.


00:54:42.435 --> 00:54:46.506
Oh, yes.
That's one way to put it.


00:54:50.109 --> 00:54:52.111
You got family back home?


00:54:54.646 --> 00:54:57.349
No.


00:54:57.381 --> 00:54:59.283
Want to, but...


00:54:59.318 --> 00:55:03.054
kind of hard in this job,
you know?


00:55:03.087 --> 00:55:06.823
Three tours I've been dodging
AAA without so much as a blink.


00:55:08.491 --> 00:55:11.027
This is the first time
I'm thinking


00:55:11.061 --> 00:55:12.295
I might not make it home.


00:55:12.329 --> 00:55:15.465
Hey.
You better come see this.


00:55:20.935 --> 00:55:24.173
- He's a heavy son of a bitch.
- Come on.


00:55:24.205 --> 00:55:26.175
Lay it down there.


00:55:48.159 --> 00:55:52.030
Found it behind the generator.


00:55:52.063 --> 00:55:53.897
Only corpse they left behind.


00:55:53.931 --> 00:55:57.068
Man, that thing is ripe.


00:55:57.102 --> 00:56:00.404
Ugly bastard, too.


00:56:00.437 --> 00:56:03.373
That's a face
only a mother could love.


00:56:03.407 --> 00:56:05.942
The hell are we
dealing with, Doc?


00:56:05.974 --> 00:56:08.112
Like I should know.


00:56:08.145 --> 00:56:10.114
You're all we've got.


00:56:10.146 --> 00:56:12.415
That's some combination.


00:56:15.083 --> 00:56:17.918
Yeah. Send the doctor in.
He'll do it.


00:56:21.956 --> 00:56:23.592
I need my equipment.


00:56:48.113 --> 00:56:49.946
Oh, look at that.


00:56:49.980 --> 00:56:54.117
His teeth are in rows
and retractable.


00:56:55.286 --> 00:56:57.254
Like a shark.


00:57:01.391 --> 00:57:03.492
He's got thick skin.


00:57:05.762 --> 00:57:08.197
Like body armor.


00:57:17.772 --> 00:57:20.508
Wow. Tough as Kevlar.


00:57:22.342 --> 00:57:24.412
Well, no wonder
they're so hard to kill.


00:57:24.445 --> 00:57:26.447
So how come it's melting?


00:57:26.481 --> 00:57:29.715
A reaction to the sunlight.


00:57:29.749 --> 00:57:32.686
I figured his DNA isn't used to
the same levels of UV


00:57:32.718 --> 00:57:35.621
we're accustomed to.


00:57:35.655 --> 00:57:38.757
So sunlight hurts it.


00:57:38.790 --> 00:57:40.426
Like an albino.


00:57:40.460 --> 00:57:43.728
Or a fucking vampire.


00:57:43.761 --> 00:57:45.196
Well, let's be honest.


00:57:45.229 --> 00:57:47.264
I really need to
take a look inside.


00:57:47.298 --> 00:57:49.133
Now, why would you want to do
a thing like that?


00:57:49.166 --> 00:57:51.569
We don't have a choice.


00:57:51.603 --> 00:57:53.603
What do you need?


00:57:56.207 --> 00:57:58.407
Tool kit.


00:58:56.359 --> 00:58:58.327
Someone give me a hand here.


00:58:58.361 --> 00:59:01.563
Get in there, Brommy.
Fill your boots.


00:59:07.835 --> 00:59:10.671
Oh, fuck's sake!


00:59:10.704 --> 00:59:13.074
Oh, I think
I'm going to be sick.


00:59:27.486 --> 00:59:28.720
Oh, my God.


00:59:28.754 --> 00:59:30.154
What's wrong?


00:59:30.188 --> 00:59:32.558
Everything's wrong.


00:59:32.591 --> 00:59:35.793
These are human organs.


00:59:35.826 --> 00:59:37.828
Nah, you've lost me, mate.


00:59:37.862 --> 00:59:40.765
One minute, they aren't human.
And now they are?


00:59:40.797 --> 00:59:42.165
Which one is it?


00:59:42.197 --> 00:59:45.068
It's both.


00:59:45.602 --> 00:59:48.572
I owe you an apology, Sinclair.


00:59:50.206 --> 00:59:56.679
Army Intelligence has had eyes
on this sector for decades.


00:59:56.712 --> 01:00:00.114
They've long suspected
a Soviet black site


01:00:00.148 --> 01:00:02.450
in the mountains near here.


01:00:02.483 --> 01:00:07.321
They could never verify it
until yesterday


01:00:07.354 --> 01:00:10.824
when you walked right into it
and found this.


01:00:13.593 --> 01:00:17.563
Now, I don't know
what the fuck's on here,


01:00:17.596 --> 01:00:19.832
but they figure it's worth
enough to tell me


01:00:19.865 --> 01:00:23.868
everything they know
so long as I keep it safe.


01:00:25.904 --> 01:00:33.211
It seems the Soviets found a way
to integrate foreign DNA


01:00:33.242 --> 01:00:35.179
into a human host.


01:00:35.212 --> 01:00:36.814
Foreign DNA?


01:00:36.847 --> 01:00:38.881
You mean like French?


01:00:40.883 --> 01:00:44.419
I mean foreign to the earth.


01:00:44.454 --> 01:00:45.721
This the bit where
we all get killed


01:00:45.755 --> 01:00:47.156
for knowing too much?


01:00:47.189 --> 01:00:49.257
We already know too much.


01:00:49.291 --> 01:00:52.427
- So don't sweat it.
- Shit.


01:00:52.462 --> 01:00:56.797
In December '79,
an object of unknown origin


01:00:56.832 --> 01:00:59.533
entered Earth's atmosphere
over Siberia


01:00:59.567 --> 01:01:03.336
and crashed somewhere
in the Hindu Kush,


01:01:03.370 --> 01:01:05.472
not too far from here.


01:01:05.506 --> 01:01:08.141
The fallen star.


01:01:10.843 --> 01:01:13.379
Yeah.


01:01:13.412 --> 01:01:17.349
The Russians sent a team
to investigate


01:01:17.383 --> 01:01:22.887
and found it was
a craft of some sort.


01:01:24.488 --> 01:01:26.624
And something was inside of it.


01:01:29.827 --> 01:01:32.796
Something the Soviet government
wanted so badly,


01:01:32.829 --> 01:01:36.299
they invaded this country
to keep it for themselves.


01:01:36.332 --> 01:01:39.201
What are you saying?


01:01:39.234 --> 01:01:43.472
The entire Russian invasion of
Afghanistan was a smokescreen?


01:01:44.939 --> 01:01:47.509
Holy shit, that's big.


01:01:47.543 --> 01:01:50.311
The Russians have
their own Roswell.


01:01:50.344 --> 01:01:53.347
The rabbit hole
gets deeper and deeper.


01:01:54.649 --> 01:01:56.483
You said there was more.


01:01:56.517 --> 01:01:59.554
How many are we talking about?


01:01:59.586 --> 01:02:01.487
There's an army down there.


01:02:01.521 --> 01:02:03.623
Last night,
they were just probing,


01:02:03.656 --> 01:02:05.892
testing our strengths,
learning our weaknesses.


01:02:05.926 --> 01:02:08.327
Means tonight, they'll be back
to finish the job.


01:02:08.360 --> 01:02:09.528
So why don't we just
load up the Hummer


01:02:09.562 --> 01:02:10.796
and get the fuck out of here?


01:02:10.828 --> 01:02:12.698
Through 70 miles
of hostile country?


01:02:12.730 --> 01:02:15.733
The fuel we got left, we'll be
lucky to make it half way.


01:02:15.767 --> 01:02:19.671
And on foot, insurgents would be
on us like flies on shit.


01:02:19.704 --> 01:02:23.975
Like it or not,
we're in this fight.


01:02:24.008 --> 01:02:25.709
All of us.


01:02:27.944 --> 01:02:31.448
Now, my life may not be
worth a plug nickel,


01:02:31.480 --> 01:02:34.684
but it's my duty
to protect yours.


01:02:34.718 --> 01:02:36.851
And I swear to you,


01:02:36.885 --> 01:02:39.687
when these motherfuckers
storm our walls,


01:02:39.722 --> 01:02:43.958
I will defend these ramparts


01:02:43.993 --> 01:02:47.628
and I will shed
my blood with yours.


01:02:47.662 --> 01:02:51.966
And I will hold this position
to the last fucking cartridge.


01:02:53.599 --> 01:02:55.869
Now let's show these fuckers


01:02:55.902 --> 01:02:57.038
what we're...


01:02:57.072 --> 01:02:59.639
Fuck!


01:03:00.006 --> 01:03:01.907
What now?


01:03:06.845 --> 01:03:08.747
That son of a bitch!


01:03:12.018 --> 01:03:13.518
Aaah!


01:03:13.551 --> 01:03:15.754
Take the shot!


01:03:15.787 --> 01:03:17.454
Shoot it, Lafayette!


01:03:17.489 --> 01:03:20.623
I can't get
a fucking clear shot!


01:03:20.657 --> 01:03:21.959
You get him, Hooky!


01:03:21.993 --> 01:03:24.360
Kick his fucking head in!


01:03:26.029 --> 01:03:28.498
Stand clear!


01:03:29.032 --> 01:03:30.832
Don't do it!


01:03:30.867 --> 01:03:32.901
Hit the deck!


01:03:38.774 --> 01:03:40.474
Major.


01:03:42.942 --> 01:03:44.779
Major.


01:03:44.812 --> 01:03:48.715
How was that for
a voluntary discharge?


01:03:52.385 --> 01:03:54.587
Finch.


01:03:54.621 --> 01:03:56.056
Finch.


01:03:58.657 --> 01:04:01.492
Is everybody else okay?


01:04:01.527 --> 01:04:03.529
Yeah.


01:04:03.562 --> 01:04:05.663
Just peachy.


01:04:10.802 --> 01:04:13.737
That was some fucked-up shit.


01:04:20.076 --> 01:04:23.013
No. No.


01:04:23.046 --> 01:04:26.383
Anybody got a problem with this?


01:04:26.414 --> 01:04:28.684
He's all right in my book.


01:04:47.501 --> 01:04:49.702
Oh, bollocks!


01:04:49.734 --> 01:04:52.637
Satcoms is shot to fuck.


01:04:52.672 --> 01:04:54.007
What about the radio
in the Hummer?


01:04:54.041 --> 01:04:55.976
The antenna was damaged
last night.


01:04:56.008 --> 01:04:59.110
It works,
but it doesn't have the range.


01:05:01.112 --> 01:05:03.381
Corporal, how we doing on ammo?


01:05:03.415 --> 01:05:04.815
Not much.


01:05:04.849 --> 01:05:07.651
About 50 rounds for the M4s,


01:05:07.684 --> 01:05:09.720
a handful of mags for sidearms,


01:05:09.753 --> 01:05:11.455
three belts for the .50-cal,


01:05:11.487 --> 01:05:13.823
- and a case of C-4.
- Shit.


01:05:13.856 --> 01:05:17.027
Seen more firepower
at a Saudi wedding.


01:05:17.060 --> 01:05:19.963
Whoa, hey, hey, hey, hey.


01:05:19.997 --> 01:05:22.531
- Still on planet Earth?
- I'm okay.


01:05:22.564 --> 01:05:26.034
That was pretty fucking sick.
Tried to suck your brains out.


01:05:26.068 --> 01:05:28.103
Not just my brains.


01:05:28.136 --> 01:05:30.173
Thoughts, like it was
draining my mind.


01:05:30.205 --> 01:05:34.109
To learn the ways
of their enemy.


01:05:34.142 --> 01:05:36.176
We still have one more trick
up our sleeve.


01:05:36.210 --> 01:05:37.945
Which is?


01:05:39.213 --> 01:05:41.481
I know where they live.


01:05:44.751 --> 01:05:47.753
Kabir, you're free to go.


01:05:47.786 --> 01:05:50.656
If you don't mind,
I would like to join you.


01:05:50.689 --> 01:05:52.824
Good man.


01:05:58.063 --> 01:06:01.099
This is personal for you,
isn't it?


01:06:01.133 --> 01:06:05.002
This knife belonged
to my father.


01:06:05.036 --> 01:06:07.871
And when I came of age,
I swore an oath


01:06:07.904 --> 01:06:11.042
that one day
I would avenge his death.


01:06:11.074 --> 01:06:13.709
That day has come.


01:06:17.780 --> 01:06:20.681
My son lost his father, too.


01:06:21.649 --> 01:06:24.153
Car accident a year ago.


01:06:25.887 --> 01:06:29.556
It's never easy for a mother
to raise a child alone.


01:06:30.091 --> 01:06:32.994
But my mother
never left my side.


01:06:40.100 --> 01:06:42.468
What the fuck am I doing here?


01:06:44.069 --> 01:06:46.904
Fighting to get home.


01:06:49.008 --> 01:06:51.509
Heads up.


01:06:51.542 --> 01:06:54.145
I found this in my shit.
Looked like your size.


01:06:54.178 --> 01:06:56.080
Borrowed?


01:06:56.114 --> 01:06:58.116
Hell no.


01:07:20.902 --> 01:07:23.805
Ladies, gentlemen,


01:07:23.837 --> 01:07:25.506
let's boogie.


01:07:25.539 --> 01:07:27.075
You jammy twat.


01:07:27.108 --> 01:07:29.042
I wish I said that.


01:07:30.576 --> 01:07:32.545
We get in quick and clean,


01:07:32.578 --> 01:07:34.814
load the C-4 in the caboose,
cut the cable,


01:07:34.847 --> 01:07:36.249
drop the package
down the throat,


01:07:36.283 --> 01:07:39.617
and blow this place
back to the Stone Age.


01:07:40.585 --> 01:07:42.288
Piece of pie, right, Sinclair?


01:07:42.321 --> 01:07:45.124
It's cake.
"Piece of cake."


01:08:08.642 --> 01:08:11.246
You okay?


01:08:11.279 --> 01:08:12.813
I don't like heights.


01:08:12.848 --> 01:08:14.950
A pilot that's
afraid of heights?


01:08:14.982 --> 01:08:16.650
Now I've heard everything.


01:08:16.684 --> 01:08:18.253
I don't much like the smell
of sweaty armpits


01:08:18.285 --> 01:08:21.588
and crotch rot, but here I am.


01:08:22.957 --> 01:08:24.724
Fair play.


01:08:24.758 --> 01:08:28.728
- C-4 is armed. We're good to go.
- All right, everyone fall back.


01:08:34.732 --> 01:08:36.069
Sinclair.


01:08:40.304 --> 01:08:41.974
Your locket.


01:08:45.344 --> 01:08:47.111
Hook!


01:08:53.884 --> 01:08:55.784
Fuck!


01:08:57.852 --> 01:08:59.990
We've got to go.


01:09:05.794 --> 01:09:07.296
Take cover, everyone.


01:09:07.328 --> 01:09:09.230
Fire in the hole.


01:09:09.265 --> 01:09:11.565
Move your ass, girl.


01:09:14.270 --> 01:09:16.071
- Sinclair.
- Wait, wait, it's Hook!


01:09:16.104 --> 01:09:17.703
He's alive.


01:09:17.738 --> 01:09:19.673
- Sinclair, do you copy?
- This is Sinclair.


01:09:19.705 --> 01:09:20.974
Where are you?


01:09:21.008 --> 01:09:23.775
I don't know.
It doesn't matter.


01:09:23.809 --> 01:09:25.777
You have to complete
the mission.


01:09:25.811 --> 01:09:28.181
Blow this place up
and get them out of there.


01:09:28.215 --> 01:09:29.781
Wait, what about you?


01:09:29.815 --> 01:09:32.284
Shit happens on the battlefield.


01:09:32.318 --> 01:09:33.752
Get home to your son.


01:09:33.785 --> 01:09:36.821
And tell him I left you to die?


01:09:36.854 --> 01:09:38.856
I don't think so.


01:09:38.889 --> 01:09:42.026
Wilks, man the winch.


01:09:42.060 --> 01:09:44.261
You're not seriously thinking
about going down there.


01:09:44.295 --> 01:09:47.297
If Kabir is right and
they are siphoning our minds,


01:09:47.331 --> 01:09:49.233
it's a cinch.


01:09:49.266 --> 01:09:52.001
They know our moves
before we even make them.


01:09:52.035 --> 01:09:55.171
I'm going in,
alone if I have to,


01:09:55.205 --> 01:09:57.941
'cause I know Hook
would do the same for me.


01:09:57.974 --> 01:10:00.742
Or any of you.


01:10:04.113 --> 01:10:07.048
All right, jockey.


01:10:07.082 --> 01:10:08.249
I'm sold.


01:10:08.282 --> 01:10:09.417
You're both nuts.


01:10:09.450 --> 01:10:12.319
That would make three of us.


01:10:12.353 --> 01:10:16.022
You wouldn't want to
miss the party, would you?


01:10:17.291 --> 01:10:20.392
Bastards, the lot of you.


01:10:20.426 --> 01:10:24.330
Hook, if you can hear me,


01:10:24.364 --> 01:10:26.031
we're coming in to get you.


01:10:26.065 --> 01:10:27.898
Sinclair, do not
come back for me.


01:10:27.933 --> 01:10:29.900
I repeat, do not come back.


01:10:55.723 --> 01:10:59.262
Wilks, if you hear the signal,
you get us out fast.


01:10:59.294 --> 01:11:00.761
Copy.


01:11:00.794 --> 01:11:02.330
Don't be late.


01:11:02.363 --> 01:11:04.064
Okay. Cover your ears.


01:11:04.098 --> 01:11:05.966
Open your mouths.


01:11:06.000 --> 01:11:07.766
And hold on tight.


01:11:07.800 --> 01:11:11.737
Three, two, one.


01:11:29.220 --> 01:11:30.855
Hold it.


01:11:45.167 --> 01:11:47.734
Touched down.


01:11:47.769 --> 01:11:51.040
If they didn't know
we were coming, they do now.


01:12:10.324 --> 01:12:12.824
<i>All personnel in range of
this signal,</i>


01:12:12.856 --> 01:12:14.360
<i>evacuate immediately.</i>


01:12:14.393 --> 01:12:17.196
<i>We are at T-minus
20 minutes and counting.</i>


01:12:17.230 --> 01:12:20.465
Hello? Hello?


01:12:20.499 --> 01:12:22.766
Hello? Fuck!


01:12:25.835 --> 01:12:28.240
<i>Sinclair,
we've got a big problem.</i>


01:12:28.273 --> 01:12:30.873
I just picked an alert
on satcoms telling anyone


01:12:30.908 --> 01:12:33.876
who's listening to evacuate
this sector right now.


01:12:33.911 --> 01:12:35.211
Copy that.


01:12:35.246 --> 01:12:36.547
How could they know
the location?


01:12:36.579 --> 01:12:38.814
Every Humvee as a transponder.


01:12:38.847 --> 01:12:41.050
We led them straight to us.


01:12:41.084 --> 01:12:42.883
It sounds like a missile strike.


01:12:42.919 --> 01:12:45.954
Whatever it is,
it's 20 minutes and counting.


01:12:49.024 --> 01:12:52.859
We gonna stand here and stare
or do this shit?


01:12:53.827 --> 01:12:55.397
Corporal, with me.


01:12:55.428 --> 01:12:58.298
Kabir, Jones, watch the rear.


01:12:58.331 --> 01:13:01.268
Brommy, you stay here
and hold the fort.


01:13:01.301 --> 01:13:03.471
Right you are, Taff.


01:13:08.108 --> 01:13:09.475
Okay.


01:13:09.508 --> 01:13:11.343
Come on.


01:15:23.526 --> 01:15:26.929
Spread out. Stay alert.
We've got 10 minutes.


01:15:33.634 --> 01:15:35.336
Hook.


01:15:35.369 --> 01:15:38.038
Do you copy?


01:15:38.072 --> 01:15:39.474
Hook.


01:15:39.507 --> 01:15:42.143
Do you copy?


01:15:42.176 --> 01:15:43.478
Hook.


01:16:23.646 --> 01:16:25.613
What did they do?


01:16:29.317 --> 01:16:31.921
These were my people.


01:17:27.436 --> 01:17:29.669
No fucking way.


01:17:34.274 --> 01:17:37.243
Sinclair, what's your 20?


01:17:37.277 --> 01:17:40.013
Fuck. We're in the lab.


01:17:43.649 --> 01:17:47.586
Follow the bio hazard signs.


01:17:47.619 --> 01:17:49.455
Sinclair?


01:17:49.488 --> 01:17:50.756
<i>Hook...</i>


01:17:50.788 --> 01:17:52.089
Shit.


01:17:52.123 --> 01:17:54.359
<i>Follow the bio hazard signs.</i>


01:17:54.392 --> 01:17:56.127
On my way.


01:18:00.463 --> 01:18:02.365
I got company!


01:18:04.735 --> 01:18:08.537
<i>T-minus 17 minutes and counting.</i>


01:18:08.571 --> 01:18:10.273
Shit.


01:18:12.608 --> 01:18:14.777
- Coming in hot!
- You might want to duck!


01:18:19.613 --> 01:18:22.116
- Empty.
- Empty.


01:18:22.150 --> 01:18:23.251
Empty.


01:18:23.284 --> 01:18:25.653
I'll keep some for emergency.


01:18:45.170 --> 01:18:47.338
They're hatching.


01:18:47.372 --> 01:18:49.674
Here we go.


01:18:53.377 --> 01:18:55.245
Come on in, you motherfuckers!


01:19:00.516 --> 01:19:01.584
Fuck.


01:19:10.927 --> 01:19:13.328
Let's not hang around, eh?


01:19:13.361 --> 01:19:15.429
This is why they took you alive.


01:19:15.462 --> 01:19:17.565
They knew I'd come for you.


01:19:20.802 --> 01:19:23.270
'Cause they read my mind.


01:19:23.303 --> 01:19:24.771
Bastards laid an ambush.


01:19:24.804 --> 01:19:27.374
Back to the elevator now!


01:19:30.543 --> 01:19:32.545
Lafayette, let's go!


01:19:47.191 --> 01:19:48.459
You better get a move on, Hooky.


01:19:48.492 --> 01:19:51.862
Yeah, nice try.


01:19:51.896 --> 01:19:53.696
Fuck off now.


01:19:53.730 --> 01:19:56.298
There's a good lad.


01:19:57.367 --> 01:19:59.435
You heard the sergeant.
Let's move.


01:20:04.406 --> 01:20:06.474
I'll be right behind you,
jockey.


01:20:06.507 --> 01:20:08.210
Go!


01:20:08.243 --> 01:20:09.811
Go!


01:20:12.313 --> 01:20:14.814
Come on, bitch! Whoo!


01:20:14.849 --> 01:20:16.550
You motherfuckers!


01:20:20.587 --> 01:20:23.657
- Which way, Captain?
- Go left. Left.


01:20:27.326 --> 01:20:29.193
Right. It's right here.


01:20:30.930 --> 01:20:32.597
It's right. Make a right.


01:20:32.630 --> 01:20:33.933
Go.


01:20:35.833 --> 01:20:37.870
Fuckers.


01:20:37.903 --> 01:20:40.203
Jammed. Jammed.


01:20:49.946 --> 01:20:52.783
- Where's Jones?
- Buying us time.


01:20:52.816 --> 01:20:54.850
- Where's Lafayette?
- Kabir.


01:20:54.885 --> 01:20:56.452
She was right behind us.


01:20:56.485 --> 01:20:58.453
- I'm going back for her.
- No, you're not.


01:20:58.486 --> 01:20:59.821
She's mine.


01:20:59.855 --> 01:21:02.489
If I'm not back in five,
get the hell out of here.


01:21:07.862 --> 01:21:09.496
Hook.


01:21:52.533 --> 01:21:54.569
We have to go. Now!


01:21:54.603 --> 01:21:56.305
We fucking wait for them!


01:22:20.093 --> 01:22:22.428
All right, motherfucker.
Let's...


01:22:23.762 --> 01:22:25.998
Fuck.


01:22:29.566 --> 01:22:30.802
Bollocks to this!


01:22:30.835 --> 01:22:33.436
Wilks, bring us up now!


01:22:36.540 --> 01:22:37.574
No.


01:23:04.931 --> 01:23:06.400
This is not the plan!


01:23:06.432 --> 01:23:07.800
No fucking shit!


01:23:07.834 --> 01:23:10.003
Wilks! Wilks!


01:23:10.037 --> 01:23:12.805
<i>Wilks, bring us up now!</i>


01:23:12.839 --> 01:23:15.774
<i>Wilks!</i>


01:23:36.759 --> 01:23:38.426
Fuck it!


01:23:40.529 --> 01:23:43.933
Eat your fucking heart out,
J.P.R.!


01:23:51.941 --> 01:23:53.574
Look out!


01:24:05.517 --> 01:24:08.821
<i>T-minus 13 minutes and counting.</i>


01:24:15.760 --> 01:24:17.762
Fuck!


01:24:28.705 --> 01:24:30.639
This damn sodding fuck!


01:24:30.672 --> 01:24:32.141
Wilks, shut it down.


01:24:32.175 --> 01:24:33.509
Shut it down now.


01:24:39.815 --> 01:24:42.851
<i>T-minus 10 minutes and counting.</i>


01:25:13.044 --> 01:25:15.947
<i>T-minus 8 minutes and counting.</i>


01:25:19.017 --> 01:25:21.119
You motherfuckers!


01:25:21.152 --> 01:25:24.087
I got your back, Sinclair.


01:25:44.537 --> 01:25:46.106
Motherfuckers!


01:26:06.091 --> 01:26:08.726
No!


01:26:08.758 --> 01:26:10.660
Fuck no!


01:26:44.124 --> 01:26:45.759
Go!


01:26:48.095 --> 01:26:49.997
Ah!


01:27:12.116 --> 01:27:14.885
Joke's on you, assholes.


01:27:20.090 --> 01:27:23.259
<i>T-minus 4 minutes and counting.</i>


01:27:32.100 --> 01:27:34.735
Looks like that rabbit hole
swallowed us both this time.


01:27:38.705 --> 01:27:40.740
Still want to kick life
in the teeth?


01:27:40.773 --> 01:27:42.574
Fuck yeah.


01:27:48.815 --> 01:27:50.315
May I?


01:27:56.955 --> 01:27:58.322
Hold tight.


01:28:16.938 --> 01:28:19.809
You miss me?


01:28:19.841 --> 01:28:22.244
Can you cut it finer next time?


01:28:23.378 --> 01:28:24.946
You were saying?


01:28:24.980 --> 01:28:28.283
<i>T-minus one minute and counting.</i>


01:28:35.687 --> 01:28:42.795
<i>30, 29, 28, 27, 26, 25, 24...</i>


01:28:42.830 --> 01:28:44.663
Let's go.


01:28:47.799 --> 01:28:52.404
<i>...18, 17, 16, 15, 14,</i>


01:28:52.436 --> 01:28:57.074
<i>13, 12, 11, 10, 9...</i>


01:28:57.108 --> 01:29:00.378
I'm going, I'm going!


01:29:00.411 --> 01:29:05.215
<i>...5, 4, 3, 2, 1.</i>


01:29:30.937 --> 01:29:32.939
Holy shit.


01:29:38.978 --> 01:29:41.914
What the fuck was that?


01:29:41.947 --> 01:29:44.282
That was someone
covering their ass.


01:30:14.074 --> 01:30:15.477
Colonel Harper,
this is Spearhead.


01:30:15.510 --> 01:30:16.977
The asset is gone.


01:30:17.011 --> 01:30:18.446
<i>Well, that's a damn shame.</i>


01:30:18.480 --> 01:30:20.080
<i>These things have
a habit of turning up.</i>


01:30:20.115 --> 01:30:24.051
<i>Return to base, Spearhead.
Harper out.</i>


01:30:27.453 --> 01:30:29.789
Better get moving.


01:30:29.821 --> 01:30:32.691
Blast will wake up
every insurgent for 100 miles.


01:30:36.528 --> 01:30:38.263
What you got there?


01:30:38.296 --> 01:30:41.199
A present from Lafayette.


01:30:45.237 --> 01:30:47.239
Come on.


01:30:47.271 --> 01:30:49.173
No time for a moment.


01:30:52.910 --> 01:30:54.411
Get me to a hotel.


01:30:54.444 --> 01:30:56.446
Get me a milkshake,
get me a bath.


01:30:56.479 --> 01:30:59.015
Will you shut up, Wilks?


01:31:01.450 --> 01:31:03.052
Oh, come on.


01:31:03.086 --> 01:31:04.286
Tell me you're joking.


01:31:04.319 --> 01:31:05.487
Wish I were.


01:31:07.522 --> 01:31:09.857
Hey, quit fooling around, Sarge.


01:31:09.890 --> 01:31:11.525
You want to get out and push?


01:31:13.794 --> 01:31:16.263
You're beginning to worry me.


01:31:17.965 --> 01:31:19.533
For fuck's sake.


01:31:19.566 --> 01:31:21.101
Come on, baby.


01:31:21.134 --> 01:31:23.237
Don't let me down.

